        ),
        body: "A weapon\'s reach comes from its projectile speed and lifetime. PDC rounds reach about 2 kilometers, railgun rounds reach 18 kilometers, and torpedoes reach about 30 kilometers.",
        wiki_path: "wiki/combat-weapons#three-reaches",
